        <ProductPageBranchInfo>&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Thanks for choosing Mid Ulster District Council. We'll now take you through a few steps to sign you up.&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
