  <Branches>
        <Branch ID="cookstown">
            <MerchantID>1111000000011205</MerchantID>
            <DDMS_Beneficiary>6725166</DDMS_Beneficiary>
            <Description>Cookstown Leisure Centre</Description>
            <ConfirmationEmail_Branch_EmailAddresses>jill.wilson@midulstercouncil.org,fintan.campbell@midulstercouncil.org,john.howard@midulstercouncil.org</ConfirmationEmail_Branch_EmailAddresses>
            <ProductPageBranchInfo>&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Information&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;Your membership includes unlimited use of the fitness suite, swimming pool, health suite and fitness classes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Concession Memberships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;This membership applies to users aged 17yo and under, aged 60yo or over and customers with a disability. Full gym membership is only available to users aged 16yo and over.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;Please note, evidence of entitlement will be required on your first visit to the Centre prior to issue of your membership card or band. Proof of age may include Driving Licence, Passport, Student ID, Bus Pass or Medical Card.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;Evidence of disability may include evidence of Disability Living Allowance, Personal Independence Allowance, Employment and Support Allowance or other supporting information from a medical professional.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Student Memberships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;This applies to users in full or part-time education. Please note, evidence of entitlement will be required on your first visit to the Centre prior to issue of your membership card or band. Proof of entitlement includes valid Student ID&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Household Memberships:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt; &lt;/strong&gt;This applies to users living at the same address and includes a maximum of two users aged 19yo and over and all users aged 18yo and under (at the time of registration). Details for the 'Lead' adult should be entered during the sign-up process. Following registration, additional users can be registered at Centre Reception. Proof of address includes a Driving Licence, Bank Statement, Utility Bill, Medical Card or addressed letter from a school (children only).&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center;"&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Please note, you will be unable to access facilities until evidence to entitlement of concession membership / proof of address for Household Memberships has been produced at Reception. Should a user be unable to evidence entitlement to concessionary rates, their membership will default to 'Adult' rate&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;</ProductPageBranchInfo>
            <ProductIDs>
                <item>4130_corporate_all_inclusive_monthly_dd_membership</item>
                <item>4130_mudc_staff_all_inclusive_monthly_dd_membership</item>
            </ProductIDs>
            <MarketingSource>
                <item>Walk By</item>
                <item>Word of Mouth</item>
                <item>Social Media</item>
                <item>Friend or Family</item>
                <item>Website</item>
            </MarketingSource>
        </Branch>
